<title>USA: US corn gluten feed demand moderate, prices steady.</title>
<headline>US corn gluten feed demand moderate, prices steady.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corn gluten feed and meal values were unchanged, dealers said. Good demand was reported for gluten feed with buyers wanting product ahead of the three-day Good Friday weekend.</p>
